    <briefdescription>
<para>Definitions for PSA random and entropy drivers. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file is part of the PSA Crypto Driver Model, containing functions for driver developers to implement to enable hardware to be called in a standardized way by a PSA Cryptographic API implementation. The functions comprising the driver model, which driver authors implement, are not intended to be called by application developers. </para>    </detaileddescription>
